            "heading": "How much does delivery cost?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Delivery costs depend on your postcode and the size of your order.</p><p>Simply enter your delivery details at checkout to see the available delivery options and shipping cost before placing your order.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_RMY4Rr": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What does standard delivery include?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Our standard delivery service brings your order to your ground-floor front door or another accessible ground-level entrance.</p><p>Deliveries generally take place Monday to Friday during business hours, excluding public holidays.</p><p>Standard delivery does not include carrying items upstairs, delivery inside your home, assembly or packaging removal.</p><p>For larger deliveries, the carrier may ask you to arrange assistance with moving the boxes after delivery.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--19742927749415__9c121ec4-42cd-4c8e-82a2-935e073db7d7-16889993318614e07a-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How will I know when my sofa is arriving?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>We'll email you when your order is dispatched.</p><p>Depending on the delivery partner, you'll also receive tracking information or be contacted directly to coordinate delivery.</p><p>Not all specialist furniture carriers provide live tracking, but we're always happy to help with delivery updates.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Cc3RMT": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I order a sofa that's currently on pre-order?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Absolutely!</p><p>If your chosen sofa is available for pre-order, you'll find the estimated availability date on its product page.</p><p>We'll keep you informed of any significant changes. If your sofa becomes available earlier than expected, we may arrange an earlier dispatch and let you know.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_N7hFQN": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I change my delivery address?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Of course. If your order hasn't been dispatched, contact us at <a href=\"mailto:support@ozroomy.com\"><strong>support@ozroomy.com</strong></a> and we'll help update your delivery details at no extra charge.</p><p>Once your order is with the delivery partner, changes may still be possible, although additional carrier fees may apply.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--19742927749415__9c121ec4-42cd-4c8e-82a2-935e073db7d7-16889993318614e07a-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can items in the same order arrive separately?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes! We normally send everything together to keep delivery simple and minimise shipping costs.</p><p>If you'd prefer to receive available items sooner, contact our team and we'll explore split delivery options.</p><p>Additional shipping charges may apply, and we'll confirm these with you before proceeding.</p>",
